---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { models, type ModelId } from '../../lib/lab/definitions';
import '../../styles/lab.css';
export function getStaticPaths(){return Object.keys(models).map(model=>({params:{model}}));}
const id=Astro.params.model as ModelId, model=models[id];
---
<Layout title={`${model.title} — Lab`} description={model.description}>
  <section class="lab-workbench wrap" data-lab={id}>
    <header class="lab-heading"><div><a class="lab-back" href="/lab/">← ALL EXPERIMENTS</a><h1>{model.title}<span>.</span></h1><p>{model.subtitle}</p></div><span class="lab-model-label">{model.tag}<br/>MODEL v1 · LOCAL COMPUTE</span></header>
    <noscript>This workbench needs JavaScript to run its local simulation.</noscript>
    <div class="lab-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" id="lab-status">Initializing simulation worker…</div>
    <div class="lab-topbar"><div class="lab-modes" role="group" aria-label="Experiment mode"><button data-mode="single" aria-pressed="true">Single</button><button data-mode="compare" aria-pressed="false">A/B comparison</button><button data-mode="scan" aria-pressed="false">Parameter scan</button></div><button id="lab-panel-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="lab-controls">Parameters ☷</button></div>
    <div class="lab-workspace">
      <div class="lab-observation">
        <div class="lab-transport"><button id="lab-run" class="lab-primary">Run ▶</button><button data-command="step" title="Advance exactly one simulation step">Step +1</button><button data-command="reset">Reset</button><button data-command="undo">Undo paint</button><span id="lab-run-state">PAUSED</span></div>
        <div class="lab-canvases"><figure><figcaption><span>A / REFERENCE</span><span id="lab-tick-a">STEP 0</span></figcaption><canvas id="lab-canvas-a" width={model.size} height={model.size} tabindex="0" aria-label="Reference simulation. Drag to paint; arrow keys move the brush, Enter paints, Space toggles run."></canvas></figure><figure id="lab-figure-b" hidden><figcaption><span>B / VARIANT</span><span id="lab-tick-b">STEP 0</span></figcaption><canvas id="lab-canvas-b" width={model.size} height={model.size} tabindex="0" aria-label="Variant simulation. Drag to paint; arrow keys move the brush, Enter paints, Space toggles run."></canvas></figure></div>
        <div class="lab-canvas-caption"><span>{model.boundary}</span><span>Drag to paint · Space to run / pause</span></div>
        <div class="lab-readouts"><div><span>Model time</span><strong id="lab-time">0</strong></div><div><span>Compute steps / s</span><strong id="lab-rate">—</strong></div><div><span>Last compute batch</span><strong id="lab-compute">—</strong></div><div><span>Display frames / s</span><strong id="lab-fps">—</strong></div></div>
        <div class="lab-compare-tools" id="lab-compare-tools" hidden><button id="lab-copy">Copy A → B</button><button id="lab-branch-reset">Reset to branch point</button><span>Both branches advance exactly one tick together.</span></div>
        <section class="lab-chart-panel"><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Measurements</h2><label>Metric <select id="lab-metric">{model.metrics.map(metric=><option value={metric}>{metric}</option>)}</select></label></div><canvas id="lab-chart" width="900" height="190" role="img" aria-label="Selected metric over simulation steps. A is mint, B is amber."></canvas><div id="lab-metric-values" class="lab-metric-values"></div><p class="lab-help">A <span class="lab-dot dot-a"></span> B <span class="lab-dot dot-b"></span> · Shared axes · Samples every 10 steps · Last 2,000 samples retained and exported.</p></section>
        <section id="lab-scan-panel" class="lab-scan-panel" hidden><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Parameter atlas</h2><span>ONE INITIAL STATE · MANY OUTCOMES</span></div><p class="lab-help">Every cell starts from the current A state and the same RNG state. Jobs run sequentially. Interactive experiments pause during the scan.</p><div id="lab-scan-axes"></div><div class="lab-scan-actions"><label>Dimensions <select id="lab-scan-dim"><option value="2">2 parameters</option><option value="1">1 parameter</option></select></label><label>Steps / cell <input id="lab-scan-steps" type="number" min="100" max="10000" step="100" value="1000"/></label><button id="lab-scan-start" class="lab-primary">Start scan</button><button data-command="cancelScan">Cancel</button><button id="lab-scan-csv">Summary CSV</button></div><progress id="lab-scan-progress" max="1" value="0" aria-label="Parameter scan progress"></progress><p id="lab-scan-status" class="lab-help">Up to 25 cells. Cancel keeps completed results.</p><div id="lab-scan-results" class="lab-scan-results"></div></section>
      </div>
      <aside id="lab-controls" class="lab-controls">
        <button id="lab-panel-close" class="lab-panel-close">Close parameters ×</button>
        <section><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Initial conditions</h2><span>01</span></div><label>Preset <select id="lab-preset">{model.presets.map((p,i)=><option value={i}>{p}</option>)}</select></label><div class="lab-two-fields"><label>Grid <select id="lab-grid"><option value="128" selected={model.size===128}>128 × 128</option><option value="256" selected={model.size===256}>256 × 256</option></select></label><label>Seed <input id="lab-seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" step="1" value="1"/></label></div><button id="lab-initialize">Reinitialize world ↻</button><p class="lab-help">Changing grid or preset creates a new world. No resampling.</p></section>
        <section><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Model parameters</h2><select id="lab-param-target" aria-label="Parameter branch"><option value="a">A / Reference</option><option value="b" disabled>B / Variant</option></select></div><div id="lab-params"></div><p class="lab-help">Changes apply at the next step. No hidden quality reduction.</p></section>
        <section><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Intervene</h2><span>03</span></div><div class="lab-two-fields"><label>Brush <select id="lab-brush">{model.brushes.map(b=><option>{b}</option>)}</select></label><label>Target <select id="lab-brush-target"><option value="a">A</option><option value="b" disabled>B</option><option value="both" disabled>Both</option></select></label></div><label>Radius <input id="lab-brush-radius" type="range" min="1" max="24" value={id==='lenia'?10:5}/></label>{id==='lenia'&&<label>Seed rotation <select id="lab-rotation"><option value="0">0°</option><option value="90">90°</option><option value="180">180°</option><option value="270">270°</option></select></label>}<label>Render view <select id="lab-view">{model.views.map((v,i)=><option value={i}>{v}</option>)}</select></label><p class="lab-help">Painting pauses time. Undo restores only the latest brush stroke. Arrow keys move the keyboard brush; Enter paints.</p>{id==='lenia'&&<div class="lab-kernel-plots"><canvas id="lab-kernel" width="400" height="130" role="img" aria-label="Radial kernel and Gaussian growth function"></canvas><p class="lab-help">Mint: radial kernel (r / R, 0–1). Amber: growth (potential, 0–1). Growth ranges −1 to +1.</p></div>}</section>
        <section><div class="lab-section-title"><h2>Keep a discovery</h2><span>04</span></div><div class="lab-action-grid"><button data-command="checkpoint">Set checkpoint</button><button data-command="restoreCheckpoint">Restore checkpoint</button><button id="lab-png">Export PNG</button><button id="lab-csv">Metrics CSV</button><button id="lab-export">Export .lab.json</button><button id="lab-import">Import .lab.json</button></div><input type="file" id="lab-file" accept=".json,.lab.json" hidden/><label>Experiment name <input id="lab-save-name" maxlength="80" placeholder="A curious observation"/></label><button id="lab-save">Save on this device</button><div id="lab-saves" class="lab-saves"></div><p class="lab-help">Local saves include both branches and completed scan cells. No cloud sync. Export to back up your work.</p></section>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <details class="lab-notes"><summary>Model notes & reproducibility</summary><p>{model.description} Simulation steps are independent of drawing frequency. Hidden tabs and page navigation pause computation; resume manually. Reproduction is deterministic within the same model version and environment; floating-point differences between browsers may accumulate.</p>{id==='reaction'&&<p>Five-point neighbors (0.2) and diagonals (0.05), center −1. Painted barriers block diffusion across their edges. See <a href="https://www.karlsims.com/rd.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Karl Sims’ reaction–diffusion tutorial ↗</a>.</p>}{id==='sand'&&<p>Sand sinks through water; water spreads; fire ignites wood and turns adjacent water into steam. Steam condenses; fire and smoke decay. These are cellular rules, not calibrated thermodynamics. Counts are conserved only when no reaction or phase change occurs.</p>}{id==='lenia'&&<p>Normalized radial polynomial kernel, Gaussian growth, Euler integration with clamping to [0, 1]. Single density channel, up to three radial rings. Orbium unicaudatus seed by <a href="https://github.com/Chakazul/Lenia" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Bert Chan ↗</a>, distributed under the <a href="/licenses/lenia.txt">MIT license</a>.</p>}</details>
  </section>
  <script>import '../../scripts/lab';</script>
</Layout>
